.venv/

# RDF/XML serialisation ordering is non-deterministic in rdflib (namespace and
# element order vary run to run), so committing it produces churn on every build.
# The Turtle in dist/ IS stable and Protege reads it natively — that is the
# committed open-and-go artifact. Run build.py if you specifically need RDF/XML.
dist/definition-atlas.owl
